        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And they related unto them all that had happened unto their wives and children, and also concerning themselves, and of their power of deliverance.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 65,
            "text": "Alma 14:8 (8–14)."
          },
          {
            "start": 125,
            "end": 130,
