        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 15:2",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And also Zeezrom lay sick at Sidom, with a burning fever, which was caused by the great tribulations of his mind on account of his wickedness, for he supposed that Alma and Amulek were no more; and he supposed that they had been slain because of his iniquity. And this great sin, and his many other sins, did harrow up his mind until it did become exceedingly sore, having no deliverance; therefore he began to be scorched with a burning heat.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 131,
            "end": 141,
            "text": "Alma 14:7 (6–7)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 15:3",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Now, when he heard that Alma and Amulek were in the land of Sidom, his heart began to take courage; and he sent a message immediately unto them, desiring them to come unto him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 15:4",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that they went immediately, obeying the message which he had sent unto them; and they went in unto the house unto Zeezrom; and they found him upon his bed, sick, being very low with a burning fever; and his mind also was exceedingly sore because of his iniquities; and when he saw them he stretched forth his hand, and besought them that they would heal him.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 241,
            "end": 252,
            "text": "Alma 14:6."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
