        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "But as to the people that were in the land of Ammonihah, they yet remained a hard-hearted and a stiffnecked people; and they repented not of their sins, ascribing all the power of Alma and Amulek to the devil; for they were of the profession of Nehor, and did not believe in the repentance of their sins.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 153,
